        "label": "A debatable claim about human nature",
        "text": "A theme is a contestable statement about how people, power, or morality work — one a reasonable reader could push back on.",
        "example": "\"In 1984, totalitarian regimes survive not by hiding cruelty but by making citizens police one another.\""
