    "incorrectLabel": "Missed it — the contrast is the engine of the sentence.",
    "calibrationNote": "Calibration is the gap between how sure you feel and how right you actually are. Track it over the unit.",
    "overconfidentNote": "High confidence on a miss: you recognized the emotional heat of the sentence but mislabeled the device. Contrast is structural; hyperbole is about exaggeration. Review antithesis before Friday's quiz.",
    "underconfidentNote": "You got it right but flagged uncertainty. Trust the read — you spotted the fetters/liberty opposition, which is exactly what antithesis is doing.",
